    &= \inf_{z > 0} \Pr\left[\exp\left(z \sum_{i \in [w]} Y_{B_i,i}\right) \ge \exp\left(\gamma z \mathbb{E}[\sum_{i \in [w]} Y_{B_i,i}]\right) \right] \\
